Output frames/
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 820
Set Height 500
Set Padding 14
Set Framerate 60
Set TypingSpeed 1ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "cd $PAINTED_RECORDING_REPO" Enter
Type "unset NO_COLOR" Enter
Type "clear; uv run demos/apps/focus_form.py" Enter
Show
Sleep 1s
Enter
Type "api.internal"
Sleep 0.8s
Enter
Tab
Enter
Type "443"
Sleep 0.8s
Enter
Tab
Enter
Type "ada"
Sleep 0.8s
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Hide
Type "q"
